{"step_index":1087,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:27:58Z","thinking":"Identified that `위드마인드` maps to `(주)위드마인드` with specific business registration numbers, implying a successful lookup or verification. Determined the total verified companies to be 194. This includes 150 companies from one source and an additional 44 companies from another source, including an explicitly identified entity.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Consolidate all 194 verified companies into master dataset","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\n\nconst SCRATCH_DIR = 'C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2/scratch';\n\n// 1. Read 150 cache\nconst cache150 = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(path.join(SCRATCH_DIR, 'details_cache_150.json'), 'utf8'));\n\n// 2. Read 43 newly verified\nconst list43 = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(path.join(SCRATCH_DIR, 'all_newly_verified_43.json'), 'utf8'));\n\n// 3. Add 엑스에이아이에듀랩스\nlist43.push({\n  rowNumber: 2264,\n  seq: '2263',\n  name: '엑스에이아이에듀랩스',\n  bizno: '729-86-02952',\n  cleanBizno: '7298602952',\n  targetCeo: '',\n  foundCeo: '김동우',\n  targetAddr: '부산진구 가야1동 467번지 창업빌리지 정보공학관 3층 307호 창업지원실',\n  foundAddr: '부산광역시 해운대구 센텀북대로 60 1409호(재송동, 센텀아이에스타워)',\n  targetPhone: '',\n  foundPhone: '',\n  foundFax: '',\n  estDate: '2023-10-23',\n  emp: '2',\n  status: '폐업자',\n  closeDate: '',\n  source: 'https://bizno.net/article/7298602952',\n  strictProof: '부산진구 통신판매신고(2024-부산진-1306) + 부산지법 법인등기(180111-1526251)'\n});\n\n// Build master map by rowNumber\nconst masterMap = {};\n\n// Add 150 companies\nfor (const [bizno, item] of Object.entries(cache150)) {\n  const r = item.rowNumber;\n  let yr = '', mo = '';\n  if (item.estDate) {\n    const parts = item.estDate.split('-');\n    yr = parts[0] || '';\n    mo = parts[1] ? String(parseInt(parts[1], 10)) : '';\n  }\n  \n  masterMap[r] = {\n    rowNumber: r,\n    name: item.companyName,\n    bizno: item.formattedBizno || `${bizno.slice(0,3)}-${bizno.slice(3,5)}-${bizno.slice(5)}`,\n    cleanBizno: bizno,\n    year: yr,\n    month: mo,\n    ceo: item.rep || '',\n    tel: item.cleanTel || item.tel || '',\n    fax: item.fax || '',\n    emp: item.emp || '',\n    status: item.status || '계속사업자',\n    closeDate: item.closeDate || '',\n    source: item.url || `https://bizno.net/article/${bizno}`,\n    proof: '비즈노 사업자등록번호 및 부산 소재지/대표자 일치'\n  };\n}\n\n// Add newly verified 44 companies\nfor (const item of list43) {\n  const r = item.rowNumber;\n  let yr = '', mo = '';\n  if (item.estDate) {\n    const parts = item.estDate.split('-');\n    yr = parts[0] || '';\n    mo = parts[1] ? String(parseInt(parts[1], 10)) : '';\n  }\n  \n  masterMap[r] = {\n    rowNumber: r,\n    name: item.name,\n    bizno: item.bizno,\n    cleanBizno: item.cleanBizno,\n    year: yr,\n    month: mo,\n    ceo: item.foundCeo || item.targetCeo || '',\n    tel: item.foundPhone || item.targetPhone || '',\n    fax: item.foundFax || '',\n    emp: item.emp || '',\n    status: item.status || '계속사업자',\n    closeDate: item.closeDate || '',\n    source: item.source,\n    proof: item.strictProof\n  };\n}\n\nconst masterList = Object.values(masterMap).sort((a, b) => a.rowNumber - b.rowNumber);\n\nconsole.log(`Total master verified companies: ${masterList.length}`);\nfs.writeFileSync(path.join(SCRATCH_DIR, 'master_verified_194.json'), JSON.stringify(masterList, null, 2), 'utf8');\n","Description":"Consolidate master 194 verified companies","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\scratch\\consolidate_master_194.js","toolAction":"Creating consolidate script","toolSummary":"Consolidate master verified companies"}}]}
